  "question": {
    "text": "Two buses <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math> start from a point at the same time and move in a straight line and their positions are represented by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>. At what time, both the buses have same velocity ?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>",
